<p>This outputs the contents of the field as a class which I can style.
However in a blog View with for example three posts on the page, this code adds all three classes to all three fields when I want each specific field content for each field instance.</p>

<p>What I'm getting is this:</p>

<pre><code>&lt;div class="field-name-field-rating2 rating-1 rating-5 rating-8"&gt;
